{"id":"f606ad8a2e","t":"A Despicable Marriage","c":"cv","n":73,"l":74,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"a-despicable-marriage"},"u":1795642845693,"desc":"لخمسة عشر عامًا، راهنت سونغ جينغتانغ بمستقبلها على حب هوو يونشن الذي لم يُقابل بالمثل، حتى أصبحت قادرة تمامًا على قول “آمين”. بعد خمس سنوات وثلاثين يومًا، وفي غيبوبة، لعنها هوو يونشن قائلًا: “لن تستيقظي أبدًا!” وكأنهم ينادون حبيبته “أمي!” انتصر حبها، وتظاهرت سونغ جينغتانغ بالعمى والضعف لمقاومة هوو…","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["جوسى","دراما","مانها"],"src":{"ml":"a-despicable-marriage"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"a-despicable-marriage|/manga/a-despicable-marriage/1/"},"2":{"ml":"a-despicable-marriage|/manga/a-despicable-marriage/2/"},"3":{"ml":"a-despicable-marriage|/manga/a-despicable-marriage/3/"},"4":{"ml":"a-despicable-marriage|/manga/a-despicable-marriage/4/"},"5":{"ml":"a-despicable-marriage|/manga/a-despicable-marriage/5/"},"6":{"ml":"a-despicable-marriage|/manga/a-despicable-marriage/6/"},"7":{"ml":"a-despicable-marriage|/manga/a-despicable-marriage/7/"},"8":{"ml":"a-despicable-marriage|/manga/a-despicable-marriage/8/"},"9":{"ml":"a-despicable-marriage|/manga/a-despicable-marriage/9/"},"10":{"ml":"a-despicable-marriage|/manga/a-despicable-marriage/10/"},"11":{"ml":"a-despicable-marriage|/manga/a-despicable-marriage/11/"},"12":{"ml":"a-despicable-marriage|/manga/a-despicable-marriage/12/"},"13":{"ml":"a-despicable-marriage|/manga/a-despicable-marriage/13/"},"14":{"ml":"a-despicable-marriage|/manga/a-despicable-marriage/14/"},"15":{"ml":"a-despicable-marriage|/manga/a-despicable-marriage/15/"},"16":{"ml":"a-despicable-marriage|/manga/a-despicable-marriage/16/"},"17":{"ml":"a-despicable-marriage|/manga/a-despicable-marriage/17/"},"18":{"ml":"a-despicable-marriage|/manga/a-despicable-marriage/18/"},"19":{"ml":"a-despicable-marriage|/manga/a-despicable-marriage/19/"},"20":{"ml":"a-despicable-marriage|/manga/a-despicable-marriage/20/"},"21":{"ml":"a-despicable-marriage|/manga/a-despicable-marriage/21/"},"22":{"ml":"a-